# Cross-language byte-parity fixtures live here.
#
# `single_series.gor` is regenerated by ./regen.sh — a wrapper around
# the Go gorillaprocessor encoder. It is intentionally not checked in
# at the time of the Phase 1 PR because the Go-side `internal/
# fixturegen` helper does not yet exist; the Rust byte-compat tests
# skip the cross-language assertions when this file is absent.
